    <briefdescription>
<para>Command execution timeout management with graceful recovery. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides robust timeout handling for child process execution, including:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Deadline-based timeout tracking using std::chrono::steady_clock</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Graceful process termination on timeout</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Resource cleanup and error reporting</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>No silent hangs or resource leaks </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
